      "en": "Pharaoh said to Jacob, “How old are you?”",
      "ko": "바로가 야곱에게 묻되 네 연세가 얼마뇨",
      "source_text_hash": "b409786860bc9ec82594acca5aaf22de9915e6e93a3bfaf634be6963f9285332",
      "translation_text_hash": "8e0991212ec7da9ea2b920a1d3b9b30b7ccfe6b0c09354e782334b53c2c5228e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "바로가 야곱에게 묻되 네 연세가 얼마뇨"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "8e0991212ec7da9ea2b920a1d3b9b30b7ccfe6b0c09354e782334b53c2c5228e"
