        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 47,
          "verse": 15
        }
      ],
      "en": "When the money was all spent in the land of Egypt, and in the land of Canaan, all the Egyptians came to Joseph, and said, “Give us bread, for why should we die in your presence? For our money fails.”",
      "ko": "애굽 땅과 가나안 땅에 돈이 진한지라 애굽 백성이 다 요셉에게 와서 가로되 돈이 진하였사오니 우리에게 식물을 주소서 어찌 주 앞에서 죽으리이까",
      "source_text_hash": "a6e988853ecd90c8dfa676b3358e420217c1a25bf8cfc19c7ddcd623369a35a4",
      "translation_text_hash": "0be1aa9da2e45f8b0c5119cb54fbb9b35cf2b731e56b952fc2788599b3759ebe",
