      ],
      "en": "As for the people, he moved them to the cities from one end of the border of Egypt even to the other end of it.",
      "ko": "요셉이 애굽 이 끝에서 저 끝까지의 백성을 성읍들에 옮겼으나",
      "source_text_hash": "d6600873e824a81be3867ba30b8d0705310d33b5b73287deec9c1accfa0a64d0",
      "translation_text_hash": "bc0d8626c31d29fc2696357b863bec23b0683eeb0c48c2554a0d1857829f36d2",
