      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 47,
          "verse": 22
        }
      ],
      "en": "Only he didn’t buy the land of the priests, for the priests had a portion from Pharaoh, and ate their portion which Pharaoh gave them. That is why they didn’t sell their land.",
      "ko": "제사장의 전지는 사지 아니하였으니 제사장은 바로에게서 녹을 받음이라 바로의 주는 녹을 먹으므로 그 전지를 팔지 않음이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "1a02493002fb3b136c3aafb5f3262cdbf9fd1b255f97c43449528bf93f2badfd",
      "translation_text_hash": "82a90225607d3e4d7d61298af9623f8a0264740754291dc2dad169511818deea",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
